+        *   Indices 0-7 correspond to binary representations of $0..7$ mapping to $(dx, dy, dz)$ where $dx, dy, dz \in \{0, childSize\}$.
+        *   Example: Child 0 at $(baseX, baseY, baseZ)$, Child 1 at $(baseX+childSize, baseY, baseZ)$, etc. [S3, unofficial]
